#: uploader.cpp:419
msgctxt "Do _NOT_ translate 'COPYING'"
msgid ""
"Sorry, we cannot create the package of your creation because we cannot find any acceptable license.\n"
" Have you specified a valid license? If you wish to use a custom license, you must make sure to include it in a file called<b>COPYING</b>."
msgstr ""
"Deit mi leed, man Dien Wark lett sik nich inpacken, dor lett sik keen passlich Verlööfnis finnen.\n"
"Hest Du en gellen Verlööfnis angeven? Wullt Du en topasst Verlöönis bruken, muttst Du en Datei mit den Naam <b>COPYING</b> bifögen."

#. +> trunk
#: uploader.cpp:423
msgid "Could not find any acceptable license"
msgstr "Keen passlich Verlööfnis funnen"

